  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Centre <math><mi>C</mi></math> of the required circle lies on the perpendicular bisector of the line segment joining <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0,5</mn></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>&amp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>6,1</mn></mfenced></math><br /><br />the midpoint of line segment joining&nbsp;<math><mi>A</mi></math> &amp; <math><mi>B</mi></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3,3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi></math><br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/seksyunnrezaponxtpetlupxaxlsdfavupdfdbtgbrnagnmebl.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 208px;\" /><br /><br />Slope of <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is <math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Slope of <math><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> equation of <math><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> is the point of intersection of <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Radius <math><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> equation of the circle is <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
